# Credentials and local state never enter the build context (F-G-17): any *.env*
# file at any depth (.env, .env.local, prod.env) except the committed *.example
# templates, the server's old file store, the InsForge CLI state, editor MCP config.
**/*.env*
!**/*.example
**/.data
**/.insforge
**/opencode.json
**/opencode.jsonc
gsc-key-temp.json
